<title>SPAIN: TABLE - Banesto H1 pretax profit up 21.5%.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Banesto H1 pretax profit up 21.5%.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First six months to end June for Grupo Banesto</p>
<p>				    (billion pesetas, unless stated)</p>
<p> Net attributable profit/loss	   17.08 vs 14.45</p>
<p> Net profit/loss			    17.89 vs 15.14</p>
<p> Pretax profit/loss			 18.4  up 21.5 pct</p>
<p> Net interest income			70.85 vs 64.49</p>
<p> Ordinary income			    99.26 vs 92.24</p>
<p> Operating income			   26.31 vs 21.37</p>
<p>Interest income			  193.35  vs  205.57</p>
<p>Interest expenses			122.50  vs  141.08</p>
<p>Fees and commissions		    22.98  vs   21.01</p>
<p>Financial/trading income		 5.43  vs    6.74</p>
<p>Operating costs			   64.41  vs   64.38</p>
<p>-personnel costs			  49.42  vs   47.05</p>
<p>-general, administrative costs	14.99  vs   17.33</p>
<p>Depreciation				 7.83  vs    8.94</p>
<p>Other operating cost		     0.71  vs    2.46 (income)</p>
<p>Amortisation of goodwill		 0.18  vs    1.58</p>
<p>Gains on group transactions	    0.49  vs    0.45</p>
<p>Loss from equity-accounted</p>
<p>holdings				     0.22  vs    3.56</p>
<p>Net loan-loss provisions		 6.75  vs    6.54</p>
<p>Writedown of investment securities   0.15  vs    0.19</p>
<p>Net extraordinaries		 1.11(loss) vs    5.18 (income)</p>
<p>Corporate income tax		     0.51  vs    0.00</p>
<p>Minorities				   0.81  vs    0.69</p>
<p>*Total assets			   5,868.63 vs 5,452.73</p>
<p>Equity					247.31 vs    213.89</p>
<p>BIS capital adequacy ratio	     11.83 vs  10.80</p>
<p>NOTE - On June 30 of this year compared with the same date in 1996.  </p>
<p>Employees (total)		     14,838   vs  15,066</p>
<p>Offices (total)			  2,340   vs   2,334</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
